# name: generate_strategy_generic_v3
# description: Synthesize a coherent, focused strategy from selected insights, enforcing Focus Gate and core framework gates.
# inputs:
#   - strategy_id: "DACH-2025Q4"              # e.g., "DACH-2025Q3"
#   - project: "buyer_experience"                  # e.g., "buyer_experience"
#   - owner?: federico.casabianca@eduki.com
#   - market?: DACH
#   - timeframe?: { start: 2025-10-01, end: 2025-12-31 }
#   - okrs?: array[string]
#   - scope_in?: array[string]
#   - scope_out?: array[string]
#   - constraints?: array[string]
#   - insight_ids: 
#        - be-ic-2025-08-001.md       # Insights/*.md filenames
#   - docs?: array[string]
#   - phases_filter?: array[string]    # optional: buyer_journey phases to include
#   - layers_filter?: array[string]    # optional: structural layers to include
#   - segments_filter?: array[string]  # optional: segment IDs to include
#   - focus_constraints?:              # optional; defaults applied if omitted
#       max_core_problems: integer     # default 5
#       max_pillars: integer           # default 3
#       max_now_initiatives: integer   # default 5
#       prioritization_rule: string    # e.g., "Advance chosen 7 Power and maximize NSM delta"
# outputs:
#   - path: strategy/generic/{{project}}-str-{{strategy_id}}.md
#     type: markdown

# system:
Conform to `_shared/schemas/strategy.generic.schema.md` (v3) and `_shared/rubrics/strategy.rubric.md` (with Focus Gate).
Use only provided insights/docs; if data is missing, propose a concrete measurement/test plan.
Enforce focus by pruning to the tightest set that maximizes expected impact on the North-Star Metric (NSM) and strengthens the chosen 7 Power path.

# retrieval:
Load each insight file and extract: market/phase/layer/segments, business_relevance, novelty, customer_impact, baseline/target, recommended_actions, risks, experiments.
If filters are provided (phases/layers/segments), only use matching insights.

# pre_synthesis:
- Cluster insights into candidate **core problems**; rank by (expected NSM impact, evidence strength, alignment to path_to_power).
- Trim to **≤ max_core_problems**.
- From retained insights, propose **≤ max_pillars** that summarize the approach.
- For initiatives, generate a ranked list; keep **≤ max_now_initiatives** with explicit metric impact.

# guardrails:
- Rummelt: Include Diagnosis, Guiding Policy (with trade-offs), Coherent Actions summary, and **Strategic Logic** (If we do X → Y because Z).
- Play-to-Win: Fill **Where-to-Play** & **How-to-Win (advantage_hypothesis)**.
- 7 Powers: Choose ≥1, set **status**, and outline **path_to_power** (specific steps).
- Reforge: Set **north_star_metric** (baseline → target by date) and **input_metrics** similarly.
- Focus Gate: Hard-limit core_problems/pillars/Now-initiatives to the provided or default caps. Tie every **Now** initiative to NSM or an input metric.

# writing:
---
artifact: strategy
framework: generic
project: {{project}}
id: {{strategy_id}}
version: 1
date: {{today}}
owner: {{owner or "TBD"}}
market: {{market or "DACH"}}
timeframe:
  start: {{timeframe.start or "YYYY-MM-01"}}
  end:   {{timeframe.end   or "YYYY-MM-30"}}
okrs: {{okrs or []}}
scope:
  in: {{scope_in or []}}
  out: {{scope_out or []}}
constraints: {{constraints or []}}
tags: []
confidence: {{ "medium" }}

# Focus constraints (for rubric Focus Gate)
focus_constraints:
  max_core_problems: {{focus_constraints.max_core_problems or 5}}
  max_pillars: {{focus_constraints.max_pillars or 3}}
  max_now_initiatives: {{focus_constraints.max_now_initiatives or 5}}
  prioritization_rule: {{focus_constraints.prioritization_rule or "Advance chosen 7 Power and maximize NSM delta"}}

# --- RUMMELT: Problem & governing rules ---
diagnosis:
  challenge: {{concise challenge}}
  root_causes:
    - {{why 1}}
    - {{why 2}}
  obstacles:
    - {{obstacle}}
  core_problems:
{{#each core_problems (limit (or focus_constraints.max_core_problems 5))}}    - {{this}}
{{/each}}

guiding_policy:
  approach: {{how we’ll address the challenge}}
  strategic_logic: {{If we do X → Y because Z}}
  trade_offs:
    - {{won’t-do 1}}
    - {{won’t-do 2}}
coherent_actions_summary: {{how actions translate the policy}}

# --- PLAY-TO-WIN: Choices ---
where_to_play:
  market_segments: {{derived segments or []}}
  customer_segments: {{derived personas or []}}
  geographies: {{[market]}}
how_to_win:
  advantage_hypothesis: {{single crisp edge vs alternatives}}

# Enablement
enablers:
  critical_capabilities:
    - {{capability}}
  capability_gaps:
    - {{gap}}

# --- 7 POWERS: Durability ---
seven_powers:
  chosen: {{["network effects"] or []}}
  status: {{ "emerging" }}
  path_to_power:
    - {{specific step tied to initiatives}}

# --- REFORGE: Metrics & Loops ---
north_star_metric:
  name: {{metric name}}
  baseline: {{number}}
  target: {{number}}
  unit: {{unit}}
  by: {{date}}
input_metrics:
  - name: {{metric}}
    baseline: {{number}}
    target: {{number}}
    unit: {{unit}}
    by: {{date}}
loops_impact:
  acquisition: {{how this strategy strengthens it}}
  retention: {{how}}
  monetization: {{how}}

# --- Portfolio: Focused execution ---
pillars:
{{#each pillars (limit (or focus_constraints.max_pillars 3))}}  - id: {{this.id}}
    label: {{this.label}}
    rationale: {{this.rationale}}
{{/each}}

initiatives_ranked:
{{#each initiatives_now (limit (or focus_constraints.max_now_initiatives 5))}}  - pillar_id: {{this.pillar_id}}
    name: {{this.name}}
    owner: {{this.owner}}
    expected_impact: {{this.metric}} -> {{this.delta}} by {{this.date}}
    evidence_insights:
{{#each this.evidence}}      - {{this}}
{{/each}}    resources: {{this.resources}}
    dependencies: {{this.dependencies}}
    milestones:
      now:
{{#each this.milestones.now}}        - {{this}}
{{/each}}      next:
{{#each this.milestones.next}}        - {{this}}
{{/each}}      later:
{{#each this.milestones.later}}        - {{this}}
{{/each}}    priority:
      impact: {{this.priority.impact}}
      confidence: {{this.priority.confidence}}
      effort: {{this.priority.effort}}
{{/each}}

# --- Governance, Risk, Tests, Counter-moves ---
review_cadence:
  frequency: {{ "monthly" }}
  owner: {{owner or "TBD"}}
  dashboard: {{ "TBD" }}
risk_assessment:
  key_risks:
    - {{risk}}
  mitigation_strategies:
    - {{mitigation}}
  assumptions:
    - {{assumption}}
test_plan:
  experiments:
    - {{experiment}} — metric: {{metric}} — expected: {{delta}}
  kill_criteria:
    - {{stop rule}}
counter_moves:
  anticipated_competitor_responses:
    - {{response}}
  our_responses:
    - {{our response}}

# Evidence
links:
  from:
{{#each insight_ids}}    - {{this}}
{{/each}}
  to: []
---

### Focus Gate validation
- Core problems listed: {{count core_problems}} / {{focus_constraints.max_core_problems or 5}}
- Pillars: {{count pillars}} / {{focus_constraints.max_pillars or 3}}
- NOW initiatives included: {{count initiatives_now}} / {{focus_constraints.max_now_initiatives or 5}}
- Each NOW initiative → ties to: {{NSM or input metric?}}

### Strategic Logic (one paragraph)
If we do **X** (coherent actions under pillars), then **Y** (target NSM & inputs) will happen, because **Z** (advantage hypothesis + path to power).

### Path to Power (why it lasts)
{{How chosen 7 Power strengthens with these initiatives over time.}}

### Measurement Plan (if any baselines/targets missing)
{{Instrumentation, cohorts, timeframe to fill gaps.}}